[{"id":1258459384260116481,"date":1588875072000,"rawContent":"One major difference is that the news treats the death of white women with more regard &amp; esteem than the loss of black lives. Hence the fight #BlackLivesMatter","userId":21978899,"media":null,"username":"heatherfink","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1258478230496923648,"date":1588879566000,"rawContent":"The murderers are Gregory MicMichael who is 64 years old and his son, Travis, 34.\n\nGreg McMichael once worked for the district attorney's office in Brunswick. He also has a background in law enforcement.\n\nBring them to justice. #AhmaudAubery #BlackLivesMatter","userId":21978899,"media":null,"username":"heatherfink","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":10,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1266613143347752960,"date":1590819080000,"rawContent":"Earlier today I was compelled to visit Rodney King\u2019s grave &amp; pay my respects. Whisper quiet here amidst so much noise &amp; so much pain. I\u2019m sorry Mr King. I hope we get things right some day. I wonder if you believe things will ever change. Rest In Peace. #BlackLivesMatter https:\/\/t.co\/lE03ejj9dy","userId":21978899,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/EZPp7K7UMAIz5YM?format=jpg&name=orig","https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/EZPp7MWUwAI8x0c?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"heatherfink","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeT